' Train jdBasic - lesson 13: 13 | HTTP and JSON | Talk to the Web
' Chapter: HTTP.GET$ - raw response
' Board edition: joins the network first. wifi.txt on the flash store
' holds the ssid on one line and the password on the next.

IF WIFI.AUTO() <> 0 THEN
    PRINT "no network - put ssid and password in wifi.txt"
    END
ENDIF

DIM url$ = "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=49.40&longitude=8.69&current_weather=true"
PRINT "Fetching..."
DIM body$ = HTTP.GET$(url$)
PRINT body$
